# 📘 TOEFL Academic Vocabulary - Day36

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| acquire | 습득하다, 획득하다 | Children acquire language through interaction. |
| diverse | 다양한 | The region contains a diverse range of species. |
| contribute | 기여하다 | Exercise can contribute to better health. |

---

## Synonyms

### acquire
→ obtain / gain

### diverse
→ varied / different

### contribute
→ help / add to

---

## Useful Collocations

acquire knowledge
→ 지식을 습득하다

acquire a skill
→ 기술을 습득하다

diverse population
→ 다양한 인구

diverse ecosystem
→ 다양한 생태계

contribute to
→ ~에 기여하다

contribute to the development of
→ ~의 발전에 기여하다

---

## Important Grammar

### contribute to + 명사 / 동명사

Technology contributes to economic growth.

Exercise contributes to improving health.

❌ contribute to improve

